\centering
\caption{Hydrodynamic rows of the first outer pass (cellwise maximum of
$|R|$ over the row's own largest term) and the outcome of the stationary
solve on the reference case, $K_{zz} = 10^{9}$, $\mathrm{He/H} = 1.6261$.}
\begin{tabular}{lccccl}
\toprule
option & hydro & mass & momentum & energy & outcome \\
\midrule
